@startuml
actor TeamMember
boundary ToDoListInterface
control TaskController
control TaskManagementService
boundary NotificationService
database Database

TeamMember -> ToDoListInterface: Access to-do list and task list page
ToDoListInterface -> TeamMember: Display interface with options to add, edit, delete tasks

TeamMember -> ToDoListInterface: Create new to-do list or task
ToDoListInterface -> TaskController: Request to create task
TaskController -> TaskManagementService: Create task
TaskManagementService -> Database: Store new task details
Database --> TaskManagementService: Confirm task creation
TaskManagementService --> TaskController: Confirm task creation
TaskController --> ToDoListInterface: Confirm task creation
ToDoListInterface --> TeamMember: Display updated task list
TaskManagementService -> NotificationService: Notify team members of new task creation
NotificationService -> TeamMember: Send notification of new task creation

TeamMember -> ToDoListInterface: Assign task to a team member
ToDoListInterface -> TaskController: Request to assign task
TaskController -> TaskManagementService: Assign task
TaskManagementService -> Database: Update task with assignee details
Database --> TaskManagementService: Confirm task update
TaskManagementService --> TaskController: Confirm task assignment
TaskController --> ToDoListInterface: Confirm task assignment
ToDoListInterface --> TeamMember: Display updated task details
TaskManagementService -> NotificationService: Notify assigned team member of new task assignment
NotificationService -> TeamMember: Send notification of new task assignment

TeamMember -> ToDoListInterface: Update task status or details
ToDoListInterface -> TaskController: Request to update task
TaskController -> TaskManagementService: Update task
TaskManagementService -> Database: Update task details
Database --> TaskManagementService: Confirm task update
TaskManagementService --> TaskController: Confirm task update
TaskController --> ToDoListInterface: Confirm task update
ToDoListInterface --> TeamMember: Display updated task details

TeamMember -> ToDoListInterface: Remove task from list
ToDoListInterface -> TaskController: Request to delete task
TaskController -> TaskManagementService: Delete task
TaskManagementService -> Database: Remove task details
Database --> TaskManagementService: Confirm task removal
TaskManagementService --> TaskController: Confirm task removal
TaskController --> ToDoListInterface: Confirm task removal
ToDoListInterface --> TeamMember: Display updated task list

TaskManagementService -> NotificationService: Send reminders for upcoming deadlines and status changes
NotificationService -> TeamMember: Send reminder notifications

TaskManagementService -> TeamMember: Display task progress and updates

@enduml
